{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09470","headline":"金谷园歌 · 韦应物","name":"金谷园歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石氏灭，金谷园中水流绝。\n当时豪右争骄侈，锦爲步障四十里。\n东风吹花雪满川，紫气凝阁朝景妍。\n洛阳陌上人回首，丝竹飘颻入青天。\n晋武平吴恣欢燕，余风靡靡朝廷变。\n嗣世衰微谁肯忧，二十四友日日空追游。\n追游讵可足，共惜年华促。\n祸端一发埋恨长，百草无情春自绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}